WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:13.410
High-value proposals should get a manager’s sign-off. Here you set the value limit and the maximum discount allowed without approval.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:19.550
When a proposal exceeds the rule, the CRM holds it and shows it in the pending approvals panel.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:27.850
The manager approves or rejects. On approval, the proposal moves forward in the pipeline and fires the linked automations.

